<title>USA: Craig Consumer CFO Richardson to retire.</title>
<headline>Craig Consumer CFO Richardson to retire.</headline>
<dateline>CERRITOS, Calif 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Craig Consumer Electronics Inc Wednesday its chief financial officer Donna Richardson would retire in July.</p>
<p>Richardson cited a desire to relocate to New England with her family as her reason for leaving, the company said.</p>
<p>Craig said it is completing the search for her replacement and expects to announce the hiring soon.</p>
